    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2649320/extras/c257de7ea95486eee378b7a900343efd.poster.avif?t=1752090081\" width=616 height=50 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2649320/extras/c257de7ea95486eee378b7a900343efd.webm?t=1752090081\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2649320/extras/c257de7ea95486eee378b7a900343efd.mp4?t=1752090081\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2649320/extras/fb91191d7f4346e5d85d450f5e9a4f09.poster.avif?t=1752090081\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2649320/extras/fb91191d7f4346e5d85d450f5e9a4f09.webm?t=1752090081\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2649320/extras/fb91191d7f4346e5d85d450f5e9a4f09.mp4?t=1752090081\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Prepare to immerse yourself in the fantastical world of <strong>Timeless Cafe</strong>, where you'll take the reins of a charming restaurant that attracts an extraordinary clientele of cute anime vampires, alluring succubi, majestic dragons and playful catgirls. As the cafe's owner, you'll embark on a dual journey of culinary excellence and heartwarming relationships with your adorable anime staff.<br><br>\ud83c\udf1f Features \ud83c\udf1f<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf7d\ufe0f Culinary Magic Meets Fantasy</h2>Whip up delectable dishes to cater to the unique palates of your extraordinary patrons. Experiment with a fusion of human and supernatural ingredients to create enchanting culinary creations that will leave your guests spellbound.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc96 Forge Unforgettable Bonds</h2>Recruit, nurture, and strengthen relationships with a diverse and charming cast of anime girls who work alongside you in the cafe. Discover their individual stories, dreams, and quirks as you venture into a world of friendship, and perhaps even romance.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf73 Manage, Enhance, and Expand</h2>Hire and train your staff to perfection, oversee daily operations, and invest in equipment to ensure your cafe. <br><br><br><strong>Timeless Cafe</strong> is an extraordinary blend of restaurant management and heartwarming relationships, set against a backdrop of captivating anime charm. Are you ready to forge connections, whip up culinary wonders, and create your own heartwarming story in this enchanting, otherworldly adventure? Join us in Timeless Cafe and be prepared to be charmed by the lovable anime characters and the magical experiences that await!",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2649320/extras/c257de7ea95486eee378b7a900343efd.poster.avif?t=1752090081\" width=616 height=50 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2649320/extras/c257de7ea95486eee378b7a900343efd.webm?t=1752090081\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2649320/extras/c257de7ea95486eee378b7a900343efd.mp4?t=1752090081\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2649320/extras/fb91191d7f4346e5d85d450f5e9a4f09.poster.avif?t=1752090081\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2649320/extras/fb91191d7f4346e5d85d450f5e9a4f09.webm?t=1752090081\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2649320/extras/fb91191d7f4346e5d85d450f5e9a4f09.mp4?t=1752090081\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Prepare to immerse yourself in the fantastical world of <strong>Timeless Cafe</strong>, where you'll take the reins of a charming restaurant that attracts an extraordinary clientele of cute anime vampires, alluring succubi, majestic dragons and playful catgirls. As the cafe's owner, you'll embark on a dual journey of culinary excellence and heartwarming relationships with your adorable anime staff.<br><br>\ud83c\udf1f Features \ud83c\udf1f<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf7d\ufe0f Culinary Magic Meets Fantasy</h2>Whip up delectable dishes to cater to the unique palates of your extraordinary patrons. Experiment with a fusion of human and supernatural ingredients to create enchanting culinary creations that will leave your guests spellbound.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc96 Forge Unforgettable Bonds</h2>Recruit, nurture, and strengthen relationships with a diverse and charming cast of anime girls who work alongside you in the cafe. Discover their individual stories, dreams, and quirks as you venture into a world of friendship, and perhaps even romance.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf73 Manage, Enhance, and Expand</h2>Hire and train your staff to perfection, oversee daily operations, and invest in equipment to ensure your cafe. <br><br><br><strong>Timeless Cafe</strong> is an extraordinary blend of restaurant management and heartwarming relationships, set against a backdrop of captivating anime charm. Are you ready to forge connections, whip up culinary wonders, and create your own heartwarming story in this enchanting, otherworldly adventure? Join us in Timeless Cafe and be prepared to be charmed by the lovable anime characters and the magical experiences that await!",
